OL,3,AAustralian shark attack victim grateful
OL,4,Afor 'second chance at life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an online post on Monday, she
OL,7,Fthanked her supporters who have raised
OL,8,Fmore than AU$550,000 (US$394,000;
OL,9,F#289,000) for her, saying her recovery
OL,10,Fhas been "incredibly difficult" but she
OL,11,Fis making "remarkable" progress.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
